0..51 Comment "//! A rule cell counts each hole in its right side."
52..55 Comment "//!"
56..117 Comment "//! The count is the hole\'s Lipschitz constant under one step"
118..204 Comment "//! [Gavazzo-2022-quantitative_metric_rewriting_abstract_nonexpansive_graded_systems]."
205..278 Comment "//! The constant is the factor by which one step can stretch the distance"
279..353 Comment "//! between two instances of the hole. Section 8.2 of the cited work gives"
354..374 Comment "//! this definition."
375..378 Comment "//!"
379..453 Comment "//! `gandr cells` reports every count. The report does not refuse a count."
454..531 Comment "//! `mirror` is linear. `left` has count zero. `twice` and `thrice` duplicate"
532..548 Comment "//! their input."
549..552 Comment "//!"
553..569 Comment "//! - see: #2788"
570..664 Comment "//! - cites: [Gavazzo-2022-quantitative_metric_rewriting_abstract_nonexpansive_graded_systems]"
665..668 Comment "//!"
669..892 Comment "//! [Gavazzo-2022-quantitative_metric_rewriting_abstract_nonexpansive_graded_systems]: https://arxiv.org/abs/2206.13610 \"Gavazzo and Di Florio, Quantitative and Metric Rewriting: Abstract, Non-Expansive, and Graded Systems\""
